rule: session-map
why: RULES.md rule 7 says each line's file name must match the base name of a .jsonl file under the submission directory, not its path; sessions/build.jsonl matches submission/export/run-3/build.jsonl, so PASS (brief: "include their native exports", folders allowed via Attach folder).
expect: pass
file: submission/planning.jsonl
| {"type":"user","text":"decompose the routing console"}
file: submission/export/run-3/build.jsonl
| {"type":"user","text":"the retry plan is wrong, stop"}
file: submission/testing.jsonl
| {"type":"user","text":"run the tests and report"}
file: SUBMISSION.md
| Session map:
| - Initial planning or decomposition: planning.jsonl, from the first message to the task list
| - Most important correction or change of direction: sessions/build.jsonl, where the retry plan is rejected
| - Final testing and verification: testing.jsonl, the last 40 messages
